{
    "_description_en": {
        "installation": "Copy to HPH_CONFIG_PATH/editor-html/external-scripts.json. Without HPH_CONFIG_PATH, use app/config/editor-html/external-scripts.json. The GUI edits this file; it is optional. Protect it from public access and allow only administrators to write it.",
        "layers": "HPH_CONFIG_OVERRIDE_PATHS adds layers. The last layer containing scripts replaces the entire list; the GUI writes to the highest layer.",
        "scripts": "A list of at most 256 definitions. A script and its optional stylesheet load only when approved and selected on the page. They also accompany HTML export. Editor, draft preview and history remain inert. Application JavaScript is separate.",
        "name": "A human-readable label, 1-160 bytes. Editors see only approved labels.",
        "type": "html for a complete ordered loading snippet containing script and link rel=\"stylesheet\" tags. Existing inline and url definitions remain supported. Module scripts and unsupported HTML are rejected.",
        "value": "For html, paste the complete loading snippet (at most 65536 bytes and 64 resources). URLs, SRI, crossorigin, classic script attributes and order are parsed automatically. HTTPS does not establish trust; validation fetches nothing.",
        "integrity": "Optional Subresource Integrity hash for a URL: sha256-, sha384- or sha512- followed by a Base64 digest. Empty means no content-integrity check. Inline scripts must leave this empty.",
        "status": "pending (default), approved, or rejected. Approving grants full JavaScript privileges on pages selecting the script, including access to page data and same-origin requests. Review source and origin first. Revocation blocks subsequent page loads, not tabs already open.",
        "id": "Derived from the exact type, value, integrity and optional CSS URL/hash. Old definitions without CSS keep their IDs. Code, URL or hash changes require a new definition and approval; names and instructions do not.",
        "imports": "New definitions from Confluence or backup are pending regardless of source approval. Existing local approval/rejection wins. Confluence automatically selects an exact locally approved match only on pages containing it; otherwise its candidate reference remains inert. The report can approve/select one page or all matching pages. Settings show direct usage, drafts and optional history. H5P follows the same rules without exceptions.",
        "examples": "The bundled DataTables definition includes CSS, JavaScript and initialization in one pending entry. Review before approval; nothing is automatically selected or executed.",
        "instructions_html": "Optional sanitized HTML usage instructions: headings, paragraphs, lists and escaped pre/code examples. Approved scripts display a help button only when this field is nonempty. Changing instructions does not change approval.",
        "css_url": "Optional absolute HTTPS stylesheet URL. Follows the script approval and page selection; emitted once per page and kept as an external link during HTML export.",
        "css_integrity": "Optional SRI digest for css_url, in the same format as integrity. With SRI the stylesheet server must allow CORS. Without it, remote stylesheet changes are not detected.",
        "instructions_translations": "Optional passive HTML instructions keyed by locale, e.g. hr/en. The interface language is used first, then English, then the first available translation. Editing help does not change script identity or approval."
    },
    "_description_hr": {
        "installation": "Kopirati u HPH_CONFIG_PATH/editor-html/external-scripts.json. Bez HPH_CONFIG_PATH koristiti app/config/editor-html/external-scripts.json. GUI uređuje ovu datoteku, ali nije obavezan. Zabraniti javni pristup i dopustiti pisanje samo administratorima.",
        "layers": "HPH_CONFIG_OVERRIDE_PATHS dodaje slojeve. Zadnji sloj koji sadrži scripts zamjenjuje cijelu listu; GUI piše u najviši sloj.",
        "scripts": "Lista do 256 definicija. Skripta i njezin neobavezni stil učitavaju se samo kada su odobreni i odabrani na stranici. Uključuju se i u HTML izvoz. Editor, pregled nacrta i povijest ostaju neizvršivi. JavaScript aplikacije je odvojen.",
        "name": "Čitljiva oznaka, 1-160 bajtova. Urednici vide samo odobrene oznake.",
        "type": "html za cjelovit uređeni isječak učitavanja s oznakama script i link rel=\"stylesheet\". Stare inline i url definicije i dalje rade. Module skripte i nepodržani HTML se odbijaju.",
        "value": "Za html zalijepite cjelovit isječak učitavanja (najviše 65536 bajtova i 64 resursa). URL, SRI, crossorigin, atributi klasičnih skripti i redoslijed čitaju se automatski. HTTPS ne jamči povjerenje; provjera ništa ne dohvaća.",
        "integrity": "Neobavezan Subresource Integrity hash za URL: sha256-, sha384- ili sha512- pa Base64 sažetak. Prazno znači da nema provjere integriteta sadržaja. Za inline mora biti prazno.",
        "status": "pending (zadano), approved ili rejected. Odobrenje daje puna JavaScript prava na stranicama koje odabiru skriptu, uključujući pristup sadržaju i zahtjeve prema istom siteu. Prvo provjeriti kod i izvor. Opoziv blokira sljedeća učitavanja, ne već otvorene tabove.",
        "id": "Izveden iz točnog type, value, integrity i neobaveznog CSS URL-a/sažetka. Stare definicije bez CSS-a zadržavaju ID. Promjene koda, URL-a ili sažetka traže novu definiciju i odobrenje; nazivi i upute ne.",
        "imports": "Nove definicije iz Confluencea ili backupa su pending bez obzira na izvorno odobrenje. Lokalno odobrenje/odbijanje ostaje. Confluence automatski odabire točno lokalno odobreno podudaranje samo na stranicama koje ga sadrže; inače referenca kandidata ostaje neizvršiva. Izvještaj omogućuje odobrenje/odabir jedne ili svih pripadajućih stranica. Postavke prikazuju izravnu upotrebu, nacrte i opcionalnu povijest. H5P nema iznimaka.",
        "examples": "Priložena DataTables definicija uključuje CSS, JavaScript i pokretanje u jednom unosu na čekanju. Pregledajte prije odobrenja; ništa se automatski ne odabire ni izvršava.",
        "instructions_html": "Neobavezna pročišćena HTML uputa: naslovi, odlomci, popisi i escapirani pre/code primjeri. Odobrene skripte imaju gumb za pomoć samo kada polje nije prazno. Promjena upute ne mijenja odobrenje.",
        "css_url": "Neobavezni apsolutni HTTPS URL stila. Prati odobrenje i odabir skripte; uključuje se jednom po stranici i ostaje vanjska poveznica u HTML izvozu.",
        "css_integrity": "Neobavezni SRI sažetak za css_url, u istom formatu kao integrity. Uz SRI poslužitelj stila mora dopustiti CORS. Bez njega naknadne promjene udaljenog stila nisu otkrivene.",
        "instructions_translations": "Neobavezne pasivne HTML upute po jeziku, npr. hr/en. Prikazuje se jezik sučelja, zatim engleski, pa prvi dostupan prijevod. Izmjena upute ne mijenja identitet ni odobrenje skripte."
    },
    "scripts": [
        {
            "id": "script-10a94ca4af23512a29786c987c8ddbd99c25702d55ae27dd68dd59a0a6bd7070",
            "name": "DataTables 3.1.4 — primjer",
            "type": "html",
            "value": "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.datatables.net/v/bs5/dt-3.1.4/datatables.min.css\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" integrity=\"sha384-T3JGdaD/z50MkBHdHHSDpnf7fv+lt9j85rrcFkblCUiWKgWvYBCIzijesG0e7o+h\">\n<script src=\"https://cdn.datatables.net/v/bs5/dt-3.1.4/datatables.min.js\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" integrity=\"sha384-D7Wdxh64tfBXMVK2xBhC5SkY7LNTaYJfLdvpJ8OUg7zBN2gVk2d4muRqhJkloYCG\"></script>\n<script>(() => {\n    // EN: This Simbioza example initializes only tables whose IDs start with \"dt-tablica-\".\n    //\n    // HR: Ovaj primjer Simbioze pokreće samo tablice čiji ID počinje s \"dt-tablica-\".\n    const start = () => {\n        const tables = document.querySelectorAll('table[id^=\"dt-tablica-\"]');\n        if (!tables.length || typeof window.DataTable !== 'function') return;\n\n        const initialize = () => {\n            tables.forEach((table) => {\n                // EN: Column headers are required; an already initialized table must not be initialized twice.\n                //\n                // HR: Zaglavlja stupaca su obavezna; već pokrenuta tablica ne smije se pokrenuti ponovno.\n                if (!table.tHead || window.DataTable.isDataTable(table)) return;\n                new window.DataTable(table, {\n                    // EN: Show ten rows per page. Search and pagination use the library's enabled defaults.\n                    //\n                    // HR: Prikaži deset redaka po stranici. Pretraga i paginacija koriste uključene zadane mogućnosti.\n                    pageLength: 10,\n                    // EN: Allow sorting on every column; keep the author's initial row order until the user sorts.\n                    //\n                    // HR: Dopusti sortiranje svakog stupca; do odabira sortiranja čuvaj izvorni redoslijed redaka.\n                    ordering: true,\n                    columnDefs: [{targets: \"_all\", orderable: true, orderSequence: [\"asc\", \"desc\"]}],\n                    order: [],\n                    // EN: Use Croatian controls on Croatian pages; otherwise retain the English library labels.\n                    //\n                    // HR: Na hrvatskim stranicama koristi hrvatske kontrole; inače zadrži engleske nazive biblioteke.\n                    language: document.documentElement.lang.startsWith('hr') ? {\n                        search: 'Pretraži:',\n                        lengthMenu: 'Prikaži _MENU_ redaka',\n                        info: 'Prikaz _START_ do _END_ od _TOTAL_ redaka',\n                        infoEmpty: 'Nema zapisa',\n                        infoFiltered: '(filtrirano od _MAX_ redaka)',\n                        zeroRecords: 'Nema odgovarajućih zapisa',\n                        emptyTable: 'Tablica nema podataka',\n                        paginate: {\n                            first: 'Prva', last: 'Zadnja',\n                            next: 'Sljedeća', previous: 'Prethodna'\n                        },\n                        aria: {\n                            orderable: ': Sortiraj po ovom stupcu',\n                            orderableReverse: ': Obrni redoslijed',\n                            orderableRemove: ': Ukloni sortiranje',\n                            paginate: {\n                                first: 'Prva stranica', last: 'Zadnja stranica',\n                                next: 'Sljedeća stranica', previous: 'Prethodna stranica',\n                                number: 'Stranica '\n                            }\n                        }\n                    } : {}\n                });\n                // EN: Translate the pagination navigation label used by assistive technologies as well.\n                //\n                // HR: Prevedi i naziv navigacije stranicama koji koriste pomoćne tehnologije.\n                if (document.documentElement.lang.startsWith('hr')) {\n                    table.closest('.dt-container')?.querySelectorAll('nav[aria-label=\"pagination\"]')\n                        .forEach((nav) => nav.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Stranice tablice'));\n                }\n            });\n        };\n\n        initialize();\n    };\n\n    // EN: Wait for page content before initializing; exported HTML can also load this code after the DOM is ready.\n    //\n    // HR: Pričekaj sadržaj stranice; izvezeni HTML može učitati ovaj kod i nakon što je DOM već spreman.\n    if (document.readyState === 'loading') {\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', start, {once: true});\n    } else {\n        start();\n    }\n})();\n</script>",
            "integrity": "",
            "status": "pending",
            "css_url": "",
            "css_integrity": "",
            "instructions_html": "<h3>How to use DataTables</h3><ol><li>An administrator approves the DataTables example. Approval alone does not enable the script on pages.</li><li>In the HTML Editor, create a table with column headers and data, without merged body cells.</li><li>In the source code, add an ID to the selected table while preserving its existing attributes:<pre><code>&lt;table id=\"dt-tablica-1\" class=\"table table-bordered\"&gt;</code></pre>For additional tables use dt-tablica-2, dt-tablica-3 and so on. Other tables remain ordinary tables.</li><li>Return to the visual editor and enable the DataTables example in External scripts.</li><li>Save the page and publish it if it belongs to a workspace. Controls work in the published view, not while editing.</li></ol><p>The example enables sorting of all columns, search and pagination. CSS loads from the same DataTables CDN.</p><p>To customize, create your own script definition and approve the new code. The example does not run until approved and selected.</p>",
            "instructions_translations": {
                "hr": "<h3>Kako koristiti DataTables</h3><ol><li>Administrator odobrava DataTables primjer. Samo odobrenje ne uključuje skriptu na stranicama.</li><li>U HTML Editoru kreirajte tablicu sa zaglavljem stupaca i podacima, bez spojenih ćelija u tijelu.</li><li>U izvornom kodu dodajte ID željenoj tablici, uz zadržavanje njezinih postojećih atributa:<pre><code>&lt;table id=\"dt-tablica-1\" class=\"table table-bordered\"&gt;</code></pre>Za druge tablice koristite dt-tablica-2, dt-tablica-3 i tako dalje. Ostale tablice ostaju obične.</li><li>Vratite se u vizualni editor i u Vanjskim skriptama uključite DataTables primjer.</li><li>Spremite stranicu i objavite je ako pripada području. Kontrole rade u objavljenom prikazu, ne tijekom uređivanja.</li></ol><p>Primjer uključuje sortiranje svih stupaca, pretragu i paginaciju. CSS se učitava iz istog DataTables CDN-a.</p><p>Za prilagodbu napravite vlastitu definiciju skripte i odobrite novi kod. Primjer se ne izvršava dok nije odobren i odabran.</p>",
                "en": "<h3>How to use DataTables</h3><ol><li>An administrator approves the DataTables example. Approval alone does not enable the script on pages.</li><li>In the HTML Editor, create a table with column headers and data, without merged body cells.</li><li>In the source code, add an ID to the selected table while preserving its existing attributes:<pre><code>&lt;table id=\"dt-tablica-1\" class=\"table table-bordered\"&gt;</code></pre>For additional tables use dt-tablica-2, dt-tablica-3 and so on. Other tables remain ordinary tables.</li><li>Return to the visual editor and enable the DataTables example in External scripts.</li><li>Save the page and publish it if it belongs to a workspace. Controls work in the published view, not while editing.</li></ol><p>The example enables sorting of all columns, search and pagination. CSS loads from the same DataTables CDN.</p><p>To customize, create your own script definition and approve the new code. The example does not run until approved and selected.</p>",
                "de": "<h3>DataTables verwenden</h3><ol><li>Ein Administrator genehmigt das DataTables-Beispiel. Die Genehmigung allein aktiviert das Skript auf keiner Seite.</li><li>Erstellen Sie im HTML-Editor eine Tabelle mit Spaltenüberschriften und Daten, ohne verbundene Zellen im Tabellenkörper.</li><li>Fügen Sie der gewünschten Tabelle im Quellcode eine ID hinzu und behalten Sie vorhandene Attribute bei:<pre><code>&lt;table id=\"dt-tablica-1\" class=\"table table-bordered\"&gt;</code></pre>Verwenden Sie für weitere Tabellen dt-tablica-2, dt-tablica-3 usw. Andere Tabellen bleiben unverändert.</li><li>Kehren Sie zum visuellen Editor zurück und aktivieren Sie das DataTables-Beispiel unter Externe Skripte.</li><li>Speichern Sie die Seite und veröffentlichen Sie sie, wenn sie zu einem Bereich gehört. Die Steuerelemente funktionieren in der veröffentlichten Ansicht, nicht beim Bearbeiten.</li></ol><p>Das Beispiel aktiviert Sortierung aller Spalten, Suche und Seitennavigation. CSS wird vom selben DataTables-CDN geladen.</p><p>Erstellen Sie für Anpassungen eine eigene Skriptdefinition und genehmigen Sie den neuen Code. Das Beispiel läuft erst nach Genehmigung und Auswahl.</p>",
                "es": "<h3>Cómo utilizar DataTables</h3><ol><li>Un administrador aprueba el ejemplo de DataTables. La aprobación por sí sola no activa el script en las páginas.</li><li>En el editor HTML, cree una tabla con encabezados y datos, sin celdas combinadas en el cuerpo.</li><li>En el código fuente, añada un ID a la tabla elegida conservando sus atributos existentes:<pre><code>&lt;table id=\"dt-tablica-1\" class=\"table table-bordered\"&gt;</code></pre>Para otras tablas utilice dt-tablica-2, dt-tablica-3, etc. Las demás tablas permanecen sin cambios.</li><li>Vuelva al editor visual y active el ejemplo de DataTables en Scripts externos.</li><li>Guarde la página y publíquela si pertenece a un espacio. Los controles funcionan en la vista publicada, no durante la edición.</li></ol><p>El ejemplo permite ordenar todas las columnas, buscar y paginar. El CSS se carga desde el mismo CDN de DataTables.</p><p>Para personalizarlo, cree su propia definición de script y apruebe el nuevo código. El ejemplo solo se ejecuta tras aprobarlo y seleccionarlo.</p>",
                "fr": "<h3>Utiliser DataTables</h3><ol><li>Un administrateur approuve l’exemple DataTables. Cette approbation seule n’active le script sur aucune page.</li><li>Dans l’éditeur HTML, créez un tableau avec des en-têtes et des données, sans cellules fusionnées dans le corps.</li><li>Dans le code source, ajoutez un ID au tableau choisi tout en conservant ses attributs existants :<pre><code>&lt;table id=\"dt-tablica-1\" class=\"table table-bordered\"&gt;</code></pre>Pour d’autres tableaux, utilisez dt-tablica-2, dt-tablica-3, etc. Les autres tableaux restent inchangés.</li><li>Revenez à l’éditeur visuel et activez l’exemple DataTables dans Scripts externes.</li><li>Enregistrez la page et publiez-la si elle appartient à un espace. Les contrôles fonctionnent dans la vue publiée, pas pendant la modification.</li></ol><p>L’exemple active le tri de toutes les colonnes, la recherche et la pagination. Le CSS provient du même CDN DataTables.</p><p>Pour personnaliser, créez votre propre définition de script et approuvez le nouveau code. L’exemple s’exécute uniquement après approbation et sélection.</p>",
                "it": "<h3>Come usare DataTables</h3><ol><li>Un amministratore approva l’esempio DataTables. La sola approvazione non attiva lo script nelle pagine.</li><li>Nell’editor HTML, creare una tabella con intestazioni e dati, senza celle unite nel corpo.</li><li>Nel codice sorgente, aggiungere un ID alla tabella scelta mantenendo gli attributi esistenti:<pre><code>&lt;table id=\"dt-tablica-1\" class=\"table table-bordered\"&gt;</code></pre>Per altre tabelle usare dt-tablica-2, dt-tablica-3 e così via. Le altre tabelle rimangono invariate.</li><li>Tornare all’editor visuale e attivare l’esempio DataTables in Script esterni.</li><li>Salvare la pagina e pubblicarla se appartiene a uno spazio. I controlli funzionano nella vista pubblicata, non durante la modifica.</li></ol><p>L’esempio attiva ordinamento di tutte le colonne, ricerca e paginazione. Il CSS viene caricato dallo stesso CDN DataTables.</p><p>Per personalizzare, creare una propria definizione dello script e approvare il nuovo codice. L’esempio si esegue solo dopo approvazione e selezione.</p>"
            }
        }
    ]
}
